# Secrets never ride inside a deployment. Production reads them from the environment
# Vercel injects; tokens that rotate live in the private Blob store. Before this file
# existed, .env was uploaded with every deploy - and a frozen copy of a rotating token is
# exactly how production ended up presenting one TikTok had already invalidated.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed at runtime.
test/
scratch/
*.docx
mekarijurnal.json
.github/
README*.md
